# Giscus — comments powered by GitHub Discussions.
# 1. Enable Discussions on your GitHub repo (Settings → General → Features).
# 2. Install the giscus app on the repo: https://github.com/apps/giscus
# 3. Generate the IDs at https://giscus.app (enter your repo, copy the values
#    from the "Enable giscus" snippet — data-repo, data-repo-id, data-category,
#    data-category-id) and paste them below.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GISCUS_REPO=
NEXT_PUBLIC_GISCUS_REPO_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY_ID=
